<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility carcasses steady, cutter firm. Demand and offerings moderate. - USDA.</p>
<p>COW &amp; BULL CARCASS FOB OMAHA	  7.0   Loads Reported.</p>
<p>			  Lds   Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
