<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up  2.0   53.50		 53.50</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up				  unq</p>
<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS  177.0  Loads Reported.</p>
